 "Flores, frutos y hongos": "Flowers, fruit and fungi",
 "Ciprés de la cordillera": "Cordilleran cypress",
 "Caen al pie del pehuén.": "They fall at the foot of the monkey puzzle.",
 "Un pez nativo del lago.": "A fish native to the lake.",
 "Madera para el invierno": "Wood for the winter",
 "Devolver lo que sacaste": "Give back what you took",
 "Cuando la nieve lo para": "When the snow stops it",
 "Preguntale por el faro.": "Ask him about the lighthouse.",
 "Lo que se ve en el agua": "What you see in the water",
 "Un viaje en la trochita": "A ride on la trochita",
 "Aserrá un tronco con Y.": "Saw a log with Y.",
 "Del otro lado del lago.": "Across the lake.",
 "Martín pescador grande": "Ringed kingfisher",
