 "Los que traían todo": "The ones who brought everything",
 "Donde empieza todo.": "Where it all starts.",
 "El salto del arroyo": "The falls on the stream",
 "armada con la manta": "pitched with the blanket",
 "hechos con el hacha": "made with the axe",
 "Cabaña del Pescador": "Fisherman's Cabin",
 "Bosque de Arrayanes": "Arrayán Forest",
 "Murciélago orejudo": "Big-eared bat",
 "La vuelta completa": "The full loop",
 "encargo de Nicanor": "errand for Nicanor",
 "La mesa del bosque": "The forest table",
 "encargo del guarda": "errand for the conductor",
 "La barba del viejo": "Old man's beard",
 "El bosque de abajo": "The forest down below",
 "Parar a tomar agua": "Stopping for water",
 "Devolverla al agua": "Putting her back in the water",
 "Refugio del Arroyo": "Stream Shelter",
 "Mirador del Pehuén": "Pehuén Lookout",
 "El ramal del valle": "The valley branch line",
 "Árboles y plantas": "Trees and plants",
 "Zorzal patagónico": "Austral thrush",
 "cinturón de Orión": "Orion's Belt",
