 "Trucha de arroyo": "Brook trout",
 "Piñones tostados": "Toasted piñones",
 "Piñones al fuego": "Piñones on the fire",
 "Levantar lo tuyo": "Build your own",
 "El banco primero": "The bench first",
 "contada por Elsa": "told by Elsa",
