 "Despertando la fauna patagónica": "Waking the Patagonian wildlife",
 "Afinando los sonidos del bosque": "Tuning the sounds of the forest",
 "Historia anotada en el cuaderno": "Story noted in the field notebook",
 "La devolvés al agua con cuidado": "You slip it back into the water",
