 "Cubierta plana transitable": "Walkable flat roof",
 "encastre al borde del piso": "snaps to the floor edge",
 "Una parte queda en el agua": "Part of it ends up in the water",
 "Ya pusiste uno acá al lado": "You already put one right here",
 "el portón de la empalizada": "the palisade gate",
 "los postigos de tu refugio": "your shelter shutters",
 "baranda al borde del piso": "railing on the floor edge",
 "escalera alineada al piso": "stairs aligned to the floor",
 "Ya tenés una obra al lado": "You already have a build right beside it",
 "los postigos del ventanal": "the wide window shutters",
 "No hay una edición activa": "There is no edit under way",
 "Pared con marco abierto": "Wall with open frame",
 "Hay que buscar un claro": "You need to find a clearing",
 "la puerta de tu refugio": "your shelter door",
 "la pieza apoyada encima": "the piece resting on top",
 "Martillo de carpintero": "Carpenter hammer",
 "Galpón de herramientas": "Tool shed",
 "los invasores abatidos": "downed invaders",
 "Elegí un plano primero": "Pick a blueprint first",
 "Justo sobre el sendero": "Right on top of the trail",
 "Cristales alienígenas": "Alien crystals",
 "Entrepiso modular 3×3": "Modular upper floor 3×3",
